      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tullytown%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Walt Disney Elementary School, a local landmark, earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places in 2007.",
